{
  "ticker": "RELIANCE",
  "side": "BUY",
  "product": "CNC",
  "strategy_family": "breakout_20d_pullback",
  "entry": 2500.0,
  "hard_stop": 2425.0,
  "target_1": 2625.0,
  "target_2": 2750.0,
  "quantity": 8,
  "time_horizon": "5-20 days",
  "thesis": "..."
}
```

`SELL` tickets are exit-only and must include the existing position reference.

